SHA256: 2c74e43c381e180762f73360c2fc7b27dc91ca724a31228fae8ed5d039350342
Section: net
Priority: optional
Description: Per-device Bluetooth identity for the OnePlus Pad 3 (erhai)
 The WCN7880 bluetooth node in the shipped DTB carries a fixed local-bd-address,
 so every device would announce the same address (C0:FF:EE:13:1E:1A). This
 package generates a random locally-administered BD address exactly once per
 device (package postinst on a running system, or first boot for image-built
 installs), persists it in /var/lib/erhai/bt-address and programs it into hci0
 via btmgmt public-addr at every boot (erhai-bt-addr.service), replacing the
 shared DTB address.

